                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In need; poor."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ad1e6357-39fe-4e0e-963d-111ec1df58d4",
                                                "sense_id": "b73faa8c-0503-3a13-b15b-7fbcadb0413f",
                                                "text": "Needy people want to give too, but have few material goods to offer."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d62f3c15-08d7-4a69-a0c9-51f6aa554ec0",
                                                "sense_id": "b73faa8c-0503-3a13-b15b-7fbcadb0413f",
                                                "text": "Such monitoring has often been a sticking point in the past, amid fears that food aid might be diverted to the Northern elite - or its military - rather than the needy."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a965348b-3915-335c-943d-2771e3e41d7e",
                                        "entry_id": "93873998-f48a-33b0-adee-8989f892cbf6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Desiring constant affirmation; lacking self-confidence."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c0d8db13-57da-459f-a7af-72a78770512c",
                                                "sense_id": "a965348b-3915-335c-943d-2771e3e41d7e",
                                                "text": "It's emotionally exhausting to be around her because she's so needy."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1a6a8def-6b11-3af8-9075-9d12abf578e8",
                                        "entry_id": "93873998-f48a-33b0-adee-8989f892cbf6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Needful; necessary."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d5a59877-419d-4064-b21b-aebdbd3745ae",
                                                "sense_id": "1a6a8def-6b11-3af8-9075-9d12abf578e8",
                                                "text": "It is the measure of things, and their time (that is, their measure, as to space and time), and yet it is above, and prior to, time: it is full in needy things, and overflows in full things; it is unutterable, innominable: it is above understanding […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
